      "content": "hey i'm trying to run this macro for our monthly reconciliation but it keeps crashing. i get \"run-time error '1004': application-defined or object-defined error\" right at the part where it tries to copy the data. can u help?\n\nSub MonthlyRecon()\n    Dim wsSource As Worksheet\n    Dim wsDest As Worksheet\n    Set wsSource = Sheets(\"Raw_Data\")\n    Set wsDest = Sheets(\"Summary\")\n    \n    ' error happens here\n    wsSource.Range(\"A2:Z100\").Copy Destination:=wsDest.Range(\"A2\")\n    \n    MsgBox \"Done!\"\nEnd Sub",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
